{"name":"Citadel","hex":"#6a7f8b","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"citadel","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A strong fortress that sits high above a city.","A stronghold or fortified place."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/citadel"}],"entries":[{"title":"Citadel","blocks":[{"text":"A citadel is the most fortified area of a town or city. It may be a castle, fortress, or fortified center. The term is a diminutive of city, meaning \"little city\", because it is a smaller part of the city of which it is the defensive core."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/59/Casale_Monferrato_map_%28018_003%29.jpg/330px-Casale_Monferrato_map_%28018_003%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Citadel"},{"title":"Citadel (TV series)","blocks":[{"text":"Citadel is an American spy action television series created by Josh Appelbaum, Bryan Oh, and David Weil for Amazon Prime Video with the Russo brothers acting as executive producers. It stars Richard Madden and Priyanka Chopra as secret agents Mason Kane and Nadia Sinh who, after being attacked by members of a rival agency and having their memories wiped, must reclaim their lost identities and fight back."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/e/e9/Citadel_Amazon_TV_Show_Promotional_Poster_v2.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Citadel_(TV_series)"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bb/Bibracte_Porte_Rebout.jpg/500px-Bibracte_Porte_Rebout.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bb/Bibracte_Porte_Rebout.jpg/500px-Bibracte_Porte_Rebout.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Reconstruction of the redoubt of Bibracte, a part of the Gaulish oppidum. The Celts utilized these fortified cities in the 2nd and 1st centuries BC.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ABibracte_Porte_Rebout.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/21/Si%C3%A9ge_de_la_flotte_turc.jpg/500px-Si%C3%A9ge_de_la_flotte_turc.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/21/Si%C3%A9ge_de_la_flotte_turc.jpg/1280px-Si%C3%A9ge_de_la_flotte_turc.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/21/Si%C3%A9ge_de_la_flotte_turc.jpg/500px-Si%C3%A9ge_de_la_flotte_turc.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Although much of Nice was ransacked during the 1543 siege of the city, Franco-Ottoman forces besieging Nice were unable to capture its Citadel. Citadels have often been used as a last defence for a besieged army.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ASi%C3%A9ge_de_la_flotte_turc.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/37/Royal_22e_R%C3%A9giment_-_panoramio.jpg/500px-Royal_22e_R%C3%A9giment_-_panoramio.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/37/Royal_22e_R%C3%A9giment_-_panoramio.jpg/1280px-Royal_22e_R%C3%A9giment_-_panoramio.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/37/Royal_22e_R%C3%A9giment_-_panoramio.jpg/500px-Royal_22e_R%C3%A9giment_-_panoramio.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"The Royal 22nd Regiment's home garrison is the Citadelle of Quebec in Canada. The citadel is the largest still in military operation in North America.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ARoyal_22e_R%C3%A9giment_-_panoramio.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/08/USS_New_Jersey_armor_citadel.jpg/500px-USS_New_Jersey_armor_citadel.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/08/USS_New_Jersey_armor_citadel.jpg/1280px-USS_New_Jersey_armor_citadel.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/08/USS_New_Jersey_armor_citadel.jpg/500px-USS_New_Jersey_armor_citadel.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Entrance to the armoured citadel of USS New Jersey","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AUSS_New_Jersey_armor_citadel.jpg"}],"sounds":{"citadel":[{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a1/En-us-citadel.ogg?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/a1/En-us-citadel.ogg/En-us-citadel.ogg.mp3"}]},"pictures":[{"title":"Grey rectangle","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0f/Grey_rectangle.jpg/500px-Grey_rectangle.jpg","ratio":0.75,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Grey_rectangle.jpg","share":0.621875},{"title":"Grey squirrel (Sciurus carolinensis) 02","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/07/Grey_squirrel_%28Sciurus_carolinensis%29_02.jpg/500px-Grey_squirrel_%28Sciurus_carolinensis%29_02.jpg","ratio":1.4993498049414824,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Grey_squirrel_(Sciurus_carolinensis)_02.jpg","share":0.248125},{"title":"Grey Bushchat in Sillery Gaon March 2025 by Tisha Mukherjee 01","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f9/Grey_Bushchat_in_Sillery_Gaon_March_2025_by_Tisha_Mukherjee_01.jpg/500px-Grey_Bushchat_in_Sillery_Gaon_March_2025_by_Tis